Article 2 (Transitional measures on formulation of emergency response plans)
Notwithstanding the amended provision of Article 22-2 (1) 1, those who manage reservoirs with a total water storage capacity of 200,000 cubic meters or more but less than 300,000 cubic meters at the time of enforcement of this Decree shall formulate an emergency response plan for the relevant reservoir by December 31, 2028.
